{"job_id":"F-cfd287d448211b519fa7","family_id":"F-cfd287d448211b519fa7","title":"각병과사병의군사경찰직무보조에관한규정","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002061-214023-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":19,"target_id":"8bf1e0b5bf0d8b4e121938b6e7a5fa1688b0092272e6941ee18bcfb7523c60eb","source_hash":"2eac0db4b843be29282ea6a75b04a6c9daa9c45ddfe29c5bb112644d77b02b7c","text":"关于各军种士兵协助执行宪兵任务的规定"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002061-214023-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":121,"target_id":"38e0584227c449689e57dba8197f7e1efe291c21c2594fb1b133364a05279e62","source_hash":"6cac261d9710f331fcad011b71f13abf0d7967cb589364e5cd35130fc324ed59","text":"第一条（命令协助执行宪兵任务的权力）  各军种参谋长（包括海军陆战队司令；以下简称“参谋长”）在认为出于军事需要时，可以命令各军种士兵临时协助执行宪兵任务。<2020年2月4日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002061-214023-ko","scope":"BODY","start":121,"end":420,"target_id":"25bd9b44cc22c488e151777fa943cd6eecda5a2db662f9176afa4eea55359146","source_hash":"d4d8f1d7687e8f4fa7ce6b20e37f941fd728555b65487db92b64684c4a110228","text":"第二条（根据请求发布命令的权力）\n① 符合下列各款规定的人员，可由宪兵司令或宪兵营营长（或在交通、通讯中断等不可避免的情况下，由宪兵连营长）因紧急军事需要征召，各兵种的士兵也可被临时授权协助宪兵履行职责。<2020年2月4日修订>\n1. 军事指挥官\n2. 师长\n3. 军团指挥官\n4.要塞指挥官\n5. 驻军指挥官\n6. 控制副指挥官\n7. 安全副指挥官\n② 按照前款规定协助执行宪兵任务的，应当立即取得各军种参谋长的批准。<2020年2月4日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002061-214023-ko","scope":"BODY","start":420,"end":493,"target_id":"035385cd92e24b4cb35a0eacff94bcb1faedd5e87f671345b6ac54d910ab4687","source_hash":"975f919a93c599bbba75d2eb8d947ddc3c1bfc2b9b3e0731a402ab7eb8497a0c","text":"第三条（解除辅助职务）各军种参谋长可根据需要解除本军种士官的宪兵辅助职务。<2020年2月4日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002061-214023-ko","scope":"BODY","start":493,"end":577,"target_id":"d80b9d07d83a5d356ebbbea4f1ac00aae5858d12abacdf397525ee6074b5dd01","source_hash":"0056ccfe85fa3a0d627f4ec262d50a1f158fcef8be7f8344d500b677c608ac41","text":"第四条（辅助宪兵的职责）辅助宪兵在宪兵司令、宪兵营营长或者下属单位司令的指挥下，临时协助宪兵履行职责。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002061-214023-ko","scope":"BODY","start":577,"end":621,"target_id":"7b65adaf4ae49773afd88bc68a5c551e582ed82c0c69244b8955e91e177c1562","source_hash":"62325a966f7a91c97e05d1cb67e124b43dfcfb52b0c38a82a79c99636e16459b","text":"第五条（宪兵条例的适用）宪兵条例适用于辅助宪兵。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002061-214023-ko","scope":"BODY","start":621,"end":705,"target_id":"c9aea5654e74210f32d47fcfcbc7549433555e00458098236f61414926f075b7","source_hash":"00fa7a1e676239df4595aeb4b0382c318d3ba56fc55dd845335a509910d51e41","text":"第六条（臂章等的使用）辅助宪兵人员佩戴与宪兵相同的臂章，并可使用与宪兵相同的武器。<2020年2月4日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002061-214023-ko","scope":"BODY","start":705,"end":749,"target_id":"04755d84ce111f25b070043d8eb21e6697398288cf3e78f258f2eac6fdbe4850","source_hash":"dd243e28563d753efb666857f52e66ac91c5ca92b73b80628381ee4837814191","text":"补充条款 <第4747号，1970年3月16日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002061-214023-ko","scope":"BODY","start":749,"end":782,"target_id":"e7a632c55ce920d295de34bc8e6524b84f5cdaab984d7566a5f5c0f1d2940b3f","source_hash":"592eb80891286d5fb32a1790211980c68a1497bf93015531466ed1a1121402b3","text":"补充条款（《军事人员法》实施令）<第30384号，2020年2月4日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002061-214023-ko","scope":"BODY","start":782,"end":811,"target_id":"c6a860b1f424dd543fd36a0eb86733e16e842b3d30eeddd78e3dc27ac2ba2e4d","source_hash":"7e5f07ffff6aef2f2136019cfb5263979ba5a34dacd8394c05b2d3c719360d57","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002061-214023-ko","scope":"BODY","start":811,"end":819,"target_id":"757f72a2198b01d7a222101ece0bff76089721a3b455eb032e6e407847158b2e","source_hash":"1fa2d78222cc5f3a7b268ba3015a524a8e57a9355a8b17e0ae4253566ef34323","text":"第 2 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002061-214023-ko","scope":"BODY","start":819,"end":1012,"target_id":"a5c21127d21754530d0f689c44bde891161337b046c8214f298d70c926a35363","source_hash":"c941cc5688e10456b04fa6cefdc40fbed174bb7f4af13133708638fed78de759","text":"第三条（修改其他法律）① 各兵种士兵协助宪兵执行任务的规定部分修改如下。\n\n  标题“各军种士兵协助宪兵执行任务的规定”应改为“各军种士兵协助宪兵执行任务的规定”。\n\n  第 1 条的标题“（命令协助执行宪兵任务的权力）”应改为“（命令协助执行宪兵任务的权力）”，并且在同一条中除标题外的“宪兵”应改为“宪兵”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002061-214023-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1012,"end":1150,"target_id":"9eb71403fa85abf434b090f58d8cd00a446d4d11a02b6eed3d1ab6f62f0d48cb","source_hash":"0d3bbb4398c6b09481dba53a3f23ed2ba2818258b0605911f7dab19f76a20e9a","text":"  除第2条各款外，其余部分中的“宪兵司令”改为“宪兵司令”，“宪兵营司令”改为“宪兵营司令”，“宪兵连司令”改为“宪兵连连长”，“宪兵医生”改为“宪兵医生”；同条第2款中的“宪兵职责”改为“宪兵职责”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002061-214023-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1150,"end":1204,"target_id":"957cf6fae73a319a3ee48686e504c54e91b81fa82602e27126d2242b064054ac","source_hash":"cd1bbf919c45e94e3bdcc2d820a15fe1e588137a24e099c1d34ccb695d4d2e83","text":"  第三条中的“宪兵辅助职务”应改为“宪兵辅助职务”。\n\n  第四条内容如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002061-214023-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1204,"end":1309,"target_id":"73f7edf6295f9899340a382cc74d9e026d7b1c2b4b6ebce87ad04427afb413df","source_hash":"b0be631816213f59db01a8241d9c93150e40017fad0d8947b04f9ffc8262c509","text":"  第四条（辅助宪兵的职责）辅助宪兵在宪兵司令、宪兵营营长或下属单位司令的指挥下，临时协助宪兵履行职责。\n\n  第五条内容如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002061-214023-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1309,"end":1355,"target_id":"51f9ca5a9eeae863a555e574c0c9e4a8a86ae59e044373d7f63aff09d1acb667","source_hash":"94f3430c4cef48b142a7cd1a02fcbe8305826ffeefdf301329bd456de2842df1","text":"  第五条（宪兵条例的适用）宪兵条例适用于辅助宪兵。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002061-214023-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1355,"end":1424,"target_id":"cf8dd355c5e288eebb245a6dbeb46e7b134068eb84efc8e4326c8662ee7aff88","source_hash":"d890d56911851bdbcd1099206ac9828ed8253115235682e919dff003912bd717","text":"  第六条中，“辅助宪兵士兵”应改为“辅助宪兵士兵”，“宪兵”应改为“宪兵”。 \n\n  ② 至 ⑭ 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002061-214023-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1424,"end":1430,"target_id":"f46255808fb0703ea3187bebc1277a1fd7631d3411a0bd2cdac5be3354cae5fe","source_hash":"c1376a54f1328c22ca6bd27070bb8f04b987e122c2316b98fe3c2cb56d2883a8","text":"第3条省略"}]}